BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Catamount Arts Gala: An Evening for the Arts
DTSTART:20261114T170000
DTEND:20261114T220000
DTSTAMP:20261114T171244Z
UID:17bd6491469ad5921ad493d368f3f5@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Catamount Arts and Burke Mountain Resort are pleased to announ
 ce An Evening for the Arts\, Saturday\, November 14th\, starting at 5pm. L
 ast year’s Catamount Arts 50th Anniversary gala at Burke Mountain was so
  popular\, the resort is hosting this year’s annual fundraiser as well. 
 Connect with family\, friends\, and neighbors through arts\, food\, drinks
  and dancing while helping to sustain Catamount Arts. This in-person event
  is all about strengthening relationships\, having fun\, celebrating commu
 nity\, and raising $50k for 50 more years of community arts and arts educa
 tion in the Northeast Kingdom. Enjoy live music from Chad Hollister’s fu
 ll nine-piece band\, featuring special guest Luke Laplant\, and a deliciou
 s menu of delectable appetizers\, specialty cocktails\, and dinner. Commun
 ity members are encouraged to coordinate with friends and family to make a
  night—or an entire weekend—of the event by booking a room or two at a
  special discount rate. (Just mention the Catamount Arts gala when booking
  with the hotel.) Childcare is available for $10 per child 12 and under\, 
 but must be booked in advance! Childcare during the gala includes an arcad
 e pass\, food\, crafts\, and more. Like last year\, Catamount Arts will al
 so curate an online auction. Gala attendance is not required to bid in the
  auction. Stay tuned for additional information\, including the evening’
 s menu\, and buy your tickets soon! Gala tickets\, childcare slots\, and h
 otel rooms are limited\, and this event is expected to sell out! Watch www
 .catamountarts.org for more details. Please call the Catamount Arts box of
 fice at 802-748-2600 to share information about food allergies or dietary 
 restrictions.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Burke Mountain Resort Hotel\, 2559 Mountain Road
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/catamount-
 arts-gala-an-evening-for-the-arts-20-10-2026-14-58-38
END:VEVENT
