BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Find Your Glow: Free Lantern Workshop
DTSTART:20261114T100000
DTEND:20261114T140000
DTSTAMP:20261114T171244Z
UID:30ae00151895e79c0c24f17480a6b4@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The Lantern Parade is coming on November 21st\, and first\, we
  need some lanterns! Join us Saturdays\, November 7 & 14\, from 10am–2pm
  at the TW Wood Museum for fun\, hands-on lantern-making sessions. Build w
 illow and paper lanterns in two elegant styles or design something entirel
 y your own. All ages and skill levels are welcome. Workshops are led by lo
 cal artist Sabrina Fadial\, Executive Director of the TW Wood Museum. Ever
 y week through Nov 14\, 2026.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:T.W. Wood Museum\, 46 Barre Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/find-your-
 glow-free-lantern-workshop-03-11-2026-14-13-44
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FlynnZONE Kids Hour: Papi Paul
DTSTART:20261114T100000
DTEND:20261114T120000
DTSTAMP:20261114T171244Z
UID:0b943065b4f1f4c1904cad6554a19c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Young children show up with unbridled curiosity\, an eagerness
  to create\, and pride in what they produce. Apply this to song writing an
 d the results are often magnificent! Join me and enjoy the catalog of orig
 inal music written with children as young as 3. I have been a teaching art
 ist in schools for 12 years. With my guitar\, voice\, teaching style\, and
  themes to write about\, there is no limit to the song ideas! FlynnZone Ki
 ds Hour is a free monthly performance series that introduces children ages
  3–5 and their caregivers to the joy of live arts through interactive pe
 rformances by local artists. Held on the second Saturday of each month\, K
 ids Hour creates welcoming opportunities for families to explore\, play\, 
 and build lasting connections through the arts.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:The Flynn\, 153 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/flynnzone-
 kids-hour-papi-paul-21-10-2026-11-45-09
END:VEVENT
