 ve charm\, seasonal delights\, and a little autumn magic. Wander among loc
 al artisans and makers\, discover thoughtful holiday gifts\, enter raffles
 \, and enjoy seasonal treats\, estate wines\, tea\, cider\, and more. Sett
 le into our cozy lounge and linger with friends and family. At its heart\,
  the Harvest Festival is a celebration of community and giving back. Admis
 sion is complimentary with a non-perishable food item or cash donation\, b
 enefiting Feeding Champlain Valley and the Chittenden Emergency Food Shelf
