SUMMARY:Missisquoi River Basin Association's 30th Anniversary Celebration
DTSTART:20261114T040000
DTEND:20261114T210000
DTSTAMP:20261114T171244Z
UID:e7aac7fc00cca3190dfdc530130e5e@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The Missisquoi River Basin Association is turning 30 in 2026 a
 nd we want to celebrate with you! Join us on November 14th 2026 for dinner
  and a show at the Montgomery Town Hall (Grange). This will be an evening 
 of fun that will include food from Mill River Brewing\, drinks\, music by 
 The Tenderbellies\, local raffle and silent auction items\, good conversat
 ion\, and more! Celebrate the MRBA with dinner and a show! Together\, we w
 ill continue to restore and maintain the ecological integrity and natural 
 wonders of the Missisquoi River system. ​\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Montgomery Town Hall\, 57 North Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/missisquoi
 -river-basin-associations-30th-anniversary-celebration-17-09-2026-10-08-47
END:VEVENT
