DTSTAMP:20261114T171244Z
UID:23167a5924aa8e22717caf26f1e0ca@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:The Lysander Piano Trio is praised by The Strad for its “inc
 redible ensemble\, passionate playing\, articulate and imaginative ideas a
 nd wide palette of colors” and by The Washington Post for “an uncommon
  degree of heart-on-the-sleeve emotional frankness” and “vivid engagem
 ent carried by soaring\, ripely Romantic playing.” The Trio’s debut re
 cording After A Dream (CAG Records) was acclaimed by The New York Times fo
 r its “polished and spirited interpretations.” The Lysander Trio is de
 voted to inventive programming\, finding intriguing connections between wo
 rks from all over the world\, and uncovering lesser-known gems of the repe
 rtoire from the past to the present. Trinity Presents is a program designe
 d to bring live classical music to the community free of charge. We are fo
 rtunate to have such talented musicians all around us and their music is s
 howcased through this program.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Trinity Episcopal Church\, 85 West Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/trinity-pr
 esents-lysander-piano-trio-05-10-2026-14-03-35
